that, like to call that absorption, where buying and selling is evenly matched. And the market is basically going sideways.

227
00:15:28,050 --> 00:15:31,055
So one of the main reasons so many traders lose money or fail at

228
00:15:31,055 --> 00:15:35,349
trading is because they come into the market thinking all you have to do is buy low and sell high.

229
00:15:35,350 --> 00:15:39,937
Oftentimes, they are buying only to have the market keep dropping after

230
00:15:39,937 --> 00:15:45,289
they have bought or sold and the market keeps on going higher against them.

231
00:15:45,730 --> 00:15:50,090
I mean, you know, in theory, it's simple. I'll just buy low and sell high.

232
00:15:50,190 --> 00:15:53,990
But how often have you bought and then the market just keeps dropping?

233
00:15:53,990 --> 00:15:56,888
Or how often times have you sold thinking this is the high

234
00:15:56,888 --> 00:16:00,269
or the end of a move and the market just keeps going against you?

235
00:16:01,270 --> 00:16:04,495
What successful traders do is buy when the market is showing strength

236
00:16:04,495 --> 00:16:06,645
and sell when the market is weak. The

237
00:16:06,645 --> 00:16:10,408
successful traders buy high and sell higher or they sell low and buy lower.

238
00:16:10,410 --> 00:16:12,430
You have to think like a mercenary.

239
00:16:12,770 --> 00:16:14,530
Yeah, I know that sounds cliche, but, you

240
00:16:14,530 --> 00:16:16,290
