241
00:16:16,290 --> 00:16:18,050
that is winning. You don't want to waste

242
00:16:18,050 --> 00:16:22,230
your time trying to fight a losing battle, trying to pick highs and lows, trying to gain some glory.

243
00:16:22,610 --> 00:16:26,310
You know, if you can see by the order flow

244
00:16:26,310 --> 00:16:30,010
that, you know, the market is starting to show some

245
00:16:30,010 --> 00:16:39,630
