388
00:25:06,230 --> 00:25:08,410
You know, that's fairly obvious.

389
00:25:08,550 --> 00:25:14,470
You know, everyone's rushing in to sell as much as they can in expectation that the market is going lower.

390
00:25:15,570 --> 00:25:18,770
You know, just a quick couple points, three points.

391
00:25:18,910 --> 00:25:20,890
Actually, delta does not take into account price.

392
00:25:20,890 --> 00:25:23,078
It doesn't, you know, you don't even,

393
00:25:23,078 --> 00:25:25,579
when you're looking at delta, you're not really

394
00:25:25,579 --> 00:25:28,080
concerned about the price of the market where

395
00:25:28,080 --> 00:25:33,708
it's trading at. Really, all you're concerned about is the net difference between the buyers and the sellers.

396
00:25:34,590 --> 00:25:38,010
When the delta is negative and price is going up, be careful.

397
00:25:38,870 --> 00:25:43,270
Why is price going up while the delta is negative?

398
00:25:43,270 --> 00:25:45,790
Well, it could be a couple of things.

399
00:25:46,630 --> 00:25:48,915
The main one is it could be support

400
00:25:48,915 --> 00:25:50,915
in the market and, you know, people

401
00:25:50,915 --> 00:25:54,629
are trying to push the market down and they're basically hitting the bids.

402
00:25:54,630 --> 00:25:57,535
But there could be somebody in there with

403
00:25:57,535 --> 00:26:00,077
a lot of, you know, a lot

404
00:26:00,077 --> 00:26:02,619
of demand, a big passive buyer that,

405
00:26:02,619 --> 00:26:08,067
you know, they're basically willing to buy as much as people are willing to sell.

406
00:26:08,070 --> 00:26:10,211
And then when those sellers are done,

407
00:26:10,211 --> 00:26:12,658
you know, they've got no more bullets left,

408
00:26:12,658 --> 00:26:16,329
so to speak, you know, the market will pop up a bit.

409
00:26:17,390 --> 00:26:19,010
And, you know, the opposite is true.

410
00:26:19,070 --> 00:26:23,170
When delta is positive and price is going down, again, be careful.

411
00:26:23,690 --> 00:26:25,901
You know, when delta is positive, you have

412
00:26:25,901 --> 00:26:27,836
more buying than selling. So if price

413
00:26:27,836 --> 00:26:31,429
is going down, you know, it shouldn't be. It should be going up.

414
00:26:31,430 --> 00:26:34,408
You know, and just to, you know,

415
